      "source_id": "cohort",
      "start": 385,
      "end": 706,
      "quote": "Among adults who passed the task at baseline, 48 of 200 with baseline MX-1 at or above 10 mock units/L and 24 of 200 with baseline MX-1 below 10 mock units/L experienced a first task failure within 12 months. Comparing the higher group with the lower group, the unadjusted risk ratio was 2.00 (95% interval 1.28 to 3.13).",
